ss=\"text-base leading-none\">🔧</span>\n<span>Mechanics</span>\n</button>\n<!-- Parts Stores -->\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 h-9 px-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm active:scale-95 transition-transform\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"text-base leading-none\">⚙️</span>\n<span>Parts Stores</span>\n</button>\n<!-- Air Pump -->\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 h-9 px-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm active:scale-95 transition-transform\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"text-base leading-none\">🛞</span>\n<span>Air Pump</span>\n</button>\n<!-- Restrooms -->\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 h-9 px-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm active:scale-95 transition-transform\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"text-base leading-none\">🚻</span>\n<span>Restrooms</span>\n</button>\n<!-- Car Wash -->\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 h-9 px-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm active:scale-95 transition-transform\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"text-base leading-none\">🚿</span>\n<span>Car Wash</span>\n</button>\n<!-- EV Charging -->\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 h-9 px-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm active:scale-95 transition-transform\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"text-base leading-none\">🔌</span>\n<span>EV Charge</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Interactive Map Viewport with Simulated Live Plugs -->\n<section class=\"relative w-full h-[330px] overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high my-space-xs\">\n<!-- Map Background Rendering Real Jamaican Corridors -->\n<div class=\"w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center\" data-location=\"Half-Way-Tree Clock Tower, Kingston, Jamaica\" style=\"background